Defender Emblem comes: it cannot be crafted from components, and it is what lifts this board above Cassiopeia Reroll, the version with Leona as the sixth Defender. Both lines three-star Cassiopeia and Rammus, Flora Azir Reroll wants Rammus too, and Rengar Master Yi Reroll and Tristana Rengar Reroll need three-star Rengar, so scout before you roll.\nL37: ## Units and items\nL38: \nL39:   * cite27†Image: Rengar cite28†Rengar Carry\nL40:   * cite29†Image: Cassiopeia cite30†Cassiopeia Carry\nL41:   * cite31†Image: Lillia cite32†Lillia No items needed\nL42:   * cite33†Image: Rammus cite34†Rammus L43:   * cite35†Image: Fiddlesticks cite36†Fiddlesticks No items needed\nL44:   * cite37†Image: Shen cite38†Shen No items needed\nL45:   * cite39†Image: Ornn cite40†Ornn No items needed\nL46: Rengar carries with Defender Emblem, Guinsoo's Rageblade and Titan's Resolve. Cassiopeia carries with Archangel's Staff, Hextech Gunblade and Spear of Shojin. Rammus takes Bramble Vest, Spirit Visage and Warmog's Armor.\nL47: ### Item order\nL48: \nL49:   1. cite11†Image: Guinsoo's Rageblade Guinsoo's Rageblade\nL50:   2. cite22†Image: Archangel's Staff Archangel's Staff\nL51:   3. cite12†Image: Titan's Resolve Titan's Resolve\nL52:   4. cite23†Image: Hextech Gunblade Hextech Gunblade\nL53:   5. cite15†Image: Bramble Vest Bramble Vest\nL54: \nL55: ## How to play Defender Rengar Reroll\nL56: ### Early game\nL57: \nL58: Defender pairs (Leona, Ornn, Shen) and hold every Rengar, Cassiopeia and Rammus copy.\nL59: \nL60:   * cite41†Image: Leona Leona\nL61:   * cite39†Image: Ornn Ornn\nL62:   * cite37†Image: Shen Shen\nL63:   * cite27†Image: Rengar Rengar\nL64:   * cite29†Image: Cassiopeia Cassiopeia\nL65: \nL66: ### Mid game\nL67: \nL68: Level 7 around 3-5 and slow roll above 50 gold for Rengar, Cassiopeia, Rammus and Fiddlesticks at three stars.\nL69: ### Late game\nL70: \nL71: Once the three-stars are done, level to 8 for Soraka: with Fiddlesticks she makes Flora Fatalis 2.\nL72: \nL73: TipRengar takes the Defender Emblem, Guinsoo's Rageblade and Titan's Resolve, Cassiopeia Archangel's Staff, Hextech Gunblade and Shojin, and Rammus Bramble Vest, Spirit Visage and Warmog's. Without the emblem, play Cassiopeia Reroll with Leona instead.\nL74: ## Best augments\nL75:   * cite42†Image: Rolling For Days cite43†Rolling For Days Silver, S tier on our list Gain 10 free Shop rerolls.\nL76:   * cite44†Image: Patience Is A Virtue cite45†Patience Is A Virtue Silver, A tier on our list Gain 4 rerolls now. Each round, gain 1 free reroll if you did not buy a champion last round.\nL77:   * cite46†Image: Staffsmith cite47†Staffsmith Gold, A tier on our list Gain 2 random completed items that build from Needlessly Large Rod.\nL78:   * cite48†Image: Beast Within cite49†Consuming Flora Gold, A tier on our list Gain a Flora Fatalis emblem. The champion holding the emblem gains 50% increased benefits from Flora Fatalis. Gain 3 gold.\nL79: Augment priority: emblems, then econ.\nL80: ## Traits\nL81: \nL82: cite50†Image: Defender Defender 6cite51†Image: Spellweaver Spellweaver 2cite52†Image: Flora Fatalis Flora Fatalis 1\nL83: \nL84: Active on the final board: 6 Defender, 2 Spellweaver, 1 Flora Fatalis and 1 Rival. Every trait is explained in the cite53†Set 18 traits guide .\nL85: \nL86: ## Late upgrades\nL87: \nL88:   * cite54†Image: Soraka Soraka added\nL89: \nL90: ## Questions about Defender Rengar Reroll\nL91: ### Is Defender Rengar Reroll good in patch 18.4b?\nL92: \nL93: Defender Rengar Reroll is X tier on the PivotTFT comp tier list for patch 18.4b: a situational comp, strong only in particular lobbies or with particular augments.\nL94: \nL95: ### When should you play Defender Rengar Reroll?\nL96: \nL97: Defender Rengar Reroll is a situational comp. Play it when you have a Defender Emblem: then it is S tier.\nL98: ### Who is the carry in Defender Rengar Reroll?\nL99: \nL100: Rengar is the main carry. Build Defender Emblem, Guinsoo's Rageblade and Titan's Resolve on Rengar.\nL101: \nL102: ### What level do you play Defender Rengar Reroll at?\nL103: \nL104: Defender Rengar Reroll is a Reroll comp: you stay at a low level and spend gold rolling for three-star copies of cheaper champions. Roll for the board at level 7.\nL105: ### How do I import Defender Rengar Reroll into TFT?\nL106: \nL107: Copy its team code with the button on this page, then open the Team Planner in the TFT client and paste it.\nL108: \nL109: ### What are the best augments for Defender Rengar Reroll?\nL110: \nL111: Rolling For Days, Patience Is A Virtue, Staffsmith and Consuming Flora. When none of these is offered, take emblems, then econ augments.\nL112: \nL113: ## Similar comps\nL114: \nL115:   * cite55†SAlune Fast 9 L116:   * cite56†SElderwood Aphelios L117:   * cite57†SFlora Azir Reroll L118: ## More comps for patch 18.4b\nL119: \nL120: S\nL121: \nL122:   * cite55†Alune Fast 9 L123:   * cite56†Elderwood Aphelios L124:   * cite57†Flora Azir Reroll L125:   * cite58†Kha'Zix Reroll L126:   * cite59†Nidalee Aphelios L127:   * cite60†Rapidfire Aphelios L128:   * cite61†Riftbeast Reroll L129:   * cite62†Veigar Reroll L130: \nL131: A\nL132:   * cite63†Akali Camille Reroll L133:   * cite64†Coven Morgana L134:   * cite65†Draven Fast 9 L135:   * cite66†Elder Dragon Fast 9 L136:   * cite67†Elderwood Ezreal L137:   * cite68†Elderwood Teemo Reroll L138:   * cite69†Executioner Ezreal Ahri L139:   * cite70†Invoker Ahri Morgana L140:   * cite71†Invoker Teemo Reroll L141:   * cite72†Lunar Kayle L142:   * cite73†Master Yi Reroll L143:   * cite74†Rengar Master Yi Reroll L144:   * cite75†Riftbeast 10 L145:   * cite76†Warwick Reroll L146: \nL147: B\nL148:   * cite77†Aphelios Vanguard L149:   * cite78†Ashe Fast 9 L150:   * cite79†Azir Reroll L151:   * cite80†Blackthorn Veigar L152:   * cite