46 L7: \nL8: cite5†Patches cite6†Guides cite7†Set 18 Info cite8†Builder L9: \nL10: cite2†Comp tier list L11: \nL12: S\nL13: # Rapidfire Aphelios TFT Set 18 comp guide\nL14: \nL15: S tier Fast 8 Medium Level 8 Patch 18.4b\nL16: \nL17: By PivotTFT · Updated 7 October 2026\nL18: \nL19: Aphelios with Rapidfire 5 behind Amumu and Sentinel: a Rapidfire Emblem on Brambleback, which most games build, joins Varus, Xayah and Mama Beak. A level 8 board that wins on attack speed.\nL20: cite9†Image: Brambleback cite10†Image: Rapidfire Emblem cite11†Image: Edge of Night cite12†Image: Sterak's Gage Brambleback cite13†Image: Sentinel Sentinel cite14†Image: Amumu cite15†Image: Evenshroud cite16†Image: Gargoyle Stoneplate cite17†Image: Warmog's Armor Amumu cite18†Image: Rakan Rakan\nL21: \nL22: cite19†Image: Aphelios cite20†Image: Infinity Edge cite21†Image: Kraken's Fury cite22†Image: Striker's Flail Aphelios cite23†Image: Varus Varus cite24†Image: Mama Beak Mama Beak cite25†Image: Xayah Xayah\nL23: \nL24: Final board. Front line at the top.\nL25: Copy link [Button: Copy team code] cite26†Open in builder L26: ## Overview\nL27: \nL28: Take it from a Rapidfire opener (Varus, Xayah, Kayle) when Bows and a Frying Pan come: together they make the Rapidfire Emblem that turns Brambleback into the fifth Rapidfire. With no Frying Pan by stage 4, Nidalee Aphelios plays the same Aphelios without an emblem. Keep Aphelios safe behind Amumu and Sentinel; his attack speed grows with every hit, so he needs time.\nL29: ## Units and items\nL30: \nL31:   * cite27†Image: Aphelios cite28†Aphelios Carry\nL32:   * cite29†Image: Brambleback cite30†Brambleback L33:   * cite31†Image: Amumu cite32†Amumu L34:   * cite33†Image: Sentinel cite34†Sentinel No items needed\nL35:   * cite35†Image: Mama Beak cite36†Mama Beak No items needed\nL36:   * cite37†Image: Rakan cite38†Rakan No items needed\nL37:   * cite39†Image: Varus cite40†Varus No items needed\nL38:   * cite41†Image: Xayah cite42†Xayah No items needed\nL39: Aphelios carries with Infinity Edge, Kraken's Fury and Striker's Flail. Brambleback takes Rapidfire Emblem, Edge of Night and Sterak's Gage. Amumu takes Evenshroud, Gargoyle Stoneplate and Warmog's Armor.\nL40: ### Item order\nL41: \nL42:   1. cite20†Image: Infinity Edge Infinity Edge\nL43:   2. cite10†Image: Rapidfire Emblem Rapidfire Emblem\nL44:   3. cite16†Image: Gargoyle Stoneplate Gargoyle Stoneplate\nL45:   4. cite21†Image: Kraken's Fury Kraken's Fury\nL46:   5. cite22†Image: Striker's Flail Striker's Flail\nL47: \nL48: ## How to play Rapidfire Aphelios\nL49: ### Early game\nL50: \nL51: Rapidfire pairs come early (Varus, Xayah, Kayle); hold Swords and Bows for Aphelios and save a Frying Pan for the emblem.\nL52: \nL53:   * cite39†Image: Varus Varus\nL54:   * cite41†Image: Xayah Xayah\nL55:   * cite43†Image: Kayle Kayle\nL56:   * cite37†Image: Rakan Rakan\nL57: \nL58: ### Mid game\nL59: \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRengar Master Yi Reroll TFT Comp, Patch 18.4b | PivotTFT (https://www.pivottft.com/comps/rengar-master-yi-reroll/)\nciteturn21view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.pivottft.com/comps/rengar-master-yi-reroll/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 191\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLunar Kayle TFT Set 18 Comp Guide, Patch 18.4b | PivotTFT (https://www.pivottft.com/comps/lunar-kayle/)\nciteturn21view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.pivottft.com/comps/lunar-kayle/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 185\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMaster Yi Reroll TFT Set 18 Comp, Patch 18.4b | PivotTFT (https://www.pivottft.com/comps/master-yi-reroll/)\nciteturn21view5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.pivottft.com/comps/master-yi-reroll/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 191\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBrambleback Ravager - TFT Meta Comp Guide Set 18 | LUM.GG (https://lum.gg/tft/team/brambleback-ravager)\nciteturn21view6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://lum.gg/tft/team/brambleback-ravager\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 202\n"